  'Open, save, and quit': {summary:'The chapter explains how to open Tux Paint, save a drawing, open a saved drawing, and quit the program.',points:['Open Tux Paint from the computer.','Use the Save tool to save your drawing.','Use the Open tool to view a previously saved drawing.','Use Quit when you have finished; save your work before closing.'],activity:'Guide students through creating a small drawing, saving it, opening it again, and quitting Tux Paint.',illustrations:[['▶️','Open','Start Tux Paint.'],['💾','Save','Keep your drawing.'],['📂','Open drawing','Return to saved work.'],['🚪','Quit','Close the program.']]},
