  'Sequence': {summary:'A sequence is a set of steps or items arranged in a specific order. The chapter uses familiar routines to show why order matters.',points:['A sequence tells us what happens first, next, and last.','Daily routines and instructions can be written as sequences.','Changing the order of steps may change the result.'],activity:'Ask students to arrange picture cards for a daily routine in the correct order.',illustrations:[['1️⃣','First','The starting step.'],['2️⃣','Next','The following step.'],['3️⃣','Last','The final step.']]},
